  "Query and act on your marketing, analytics, CRM, e-commerce, and warehouse data across 325+ connectors (Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, GA4, HubSpot, Salesforce, etc.).": "Consulte e atue sobre seus dados de marketing, analytics, CRM, e-commerce e data warehouse através de mais de 325 conectores (Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, GA4, HubSpot, Salesforce, etc.).",
